WEBVTT

00:00:09.559 --> 00:00:10.734
[PLATFORM LOWERING]

00:00:12.692 --> 00:00:14.041
Oh, hey, Branch?

00:00:14.085 --> 00:00:16.261
Just wondering
if I could borrow something.

00:00:16.305 --> 00:00:17.306
[SIGHS] What?

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:18.916
Your bunker.What?

00:00:18.959 --> 00:00:21.092
Okay, everybody.
Come on in!

00:00:21.136 --> 00:00:22.311
[ALL CLAMORING]

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:23.399
Hi, Branch!

00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:26.097
No! No! No!

00:00:26.141 --> 00:00:28.186
Whoa, wait!
Poppy, what are you doing?

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:29.535
You said
you have enough provisions

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:31.189
to last 10 years, right?

00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:33.539
Yes, to last me
10 years. Me!

00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:34.888
It'll last them two weeks!

00:00:34.932 --> 00:00:36.586
Then I guess I better hurry.

00:00:36.629 --> 00:00:37.674
Wait, wait, wait!

00:00:37.717 --> 00:00:39.371
You won't last a day
out there.

00:00:39.415 --> 00:00:42.331
And you won't last a day
in here.

00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:44.028
ALL: [CHANTING]
Chug, chug, chug!

00:00:44.071 --> 00:00:45.377
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:00:47.423 --> 00:00:49.903
Solid burn, returned.[GLASS SHATTERING]

00:00:49.947 --> 00:00:52.123
MALE TROLL: Sorry, Branch!

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:53.385
[STAMMERING] Uh, Poppy, wait.

00:00:54.734 --> 00:00:56.432
Please be careful.

00:00:56.475 --> 00:00:59.565
Don't worry, Dad.
I can do this.

00:01:00.784 --> 00:01:02.742
I love you, Poppy.

00:01:03.569 --> 00:01:05.484
I love you too, Dad.

00:01:10.097 --> 00:01:12.883
They grow up so fast.

00:01:12.926 --> 00:01:14.885
Bye, everybody!
See you soon!

00:01:14.928 --> 00:01:17.104
ALL: Good luck,
Princess Poppy!

00:01:18.671 --> 00:01:21.935
[SOFTLY] And three, two, one.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.591
Hug time!

00:01:25.635 --> 00:01:27.027
No.

00:01:27.071 --> 00:01:28.377
ALL: [CHANTING]
Hug time! Hug time!
Hug time!

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.422
No! No!

00:01:33.947 --> 00:01:35.993
POPPY: With her friends
safely hidden...

00:01:36.036 --> 00:01:38.778
Princess Poppy set off
to rescue her other friends...

00:01:38.822 --> 00:01:42.086
confident she'd make it
to Bergen Town on her own.

00:01:42.129 --> 00:01:43.609
[BERGEN SNARLING]

00:01:45.132 --> 00:01:47.309
Convinced she'd make it
to Bergen Town.

00:01:50.007 --> 00:01:51.443
[SIGHS] Um...

00:01:54.185 --> 00:01:57.319
Totally sure she'd make it
to Bergen Town.

00:01:57.797 --> 00:01:59.059
Mmm...

00:02:00.496 --> 00:02:01.845
[SIGHS]

00:02:08.504 --> 00:02:11.115
♪ I really hope
I can do it

00:02:11.158 --> 00:02:14.423
♪ 'Cause they're
all depending on me

00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:19.210
♪ I know that I must leave
the only home I've ever known

00:02:19.254 --> 00:02:21.343
♪ And brave
the dangers of the forest

00:02:21.386 --> 00:02:24.955
♪ Saving them
before they're eaten

00:02:24.998 --> 00:02:30.439
♪ I mean,
how hard can that be?

00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:32.005
[SCREAMS]

00:02:36.183 --> 00:02:37.489
[GRUNTS]

00:02:39.883 --> 00:02:41.798
♪ Looking up at a sunny sky

00:02:41.841 --> 00:02:44.235
♪ So shiny and blue
and there's a butterfly

00:02:44.279 --> 00:02:47.064
♪ Well, isn't that
a super fantastic sign?

00:02:53.549 --> 00:02:55.159
[BURPS]

00:02:55.202 --> 00:02:58.467
♪ It's gonna be
a fantastic day

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.643
♪ Such marvelousness
it's gonna bring

00:03:00.686 --> 00:03:02.993
♪ Got a pocket full of songs
that I'm gonna sing

00:03:03.036 --> 00:03:05.996
♪ And I'm ready
to take on anything

00:03:06.039 --> 00:03:07.650
♪ Hooray!

00:03:07.693 --> 00:03:12.263
♪ Some super fun surprise
around each corner

00:03:12.307 --> 00:03:15.353
♪ Just riding on a rainbow

00:03:15.397 --> 00:03:17.834
♪ I'm gonna be okay

00:03:17.877 --> 00:03:21.228
♪ Hey! I'm not
giving up today

00:03:21.272 --> 00:03:23.405
♪ There's nothing
getting in my way

00:03:23.448 --> 00:03:25.189
♪ And if you knock,
knock me over

00:03:25.232 --> 00:03:26.495
♪ I will get back up again

00:03:26.538 --> 00:03:27.931
[SQUAWKING]

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:30.934
♪ Oh! If something goes
a little wrong

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:33.153
♪ Well you can go ahead
and bring it on

00:03:33.197 --> 00:03:34.764
♪ 'Cause if you knock,
knock me over

00:03:34.807 --> 00:03:37.593
♪ I will get back up again

00:03:37.636 --> 00:03:39.159
