00:03:39.203 --> 00:03:40.596
♪ Whoa, oh, oh, oh

00:03:40.639 --> 00:03:41.727
♪ Oh, get back up again

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.688
♪ Whoa, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh

00:03:45.731 --> 00:03:47.211
Ahh!

00:03:47.254 --> 00:03:49.213
♪ I'm marching along
I've got confidence

00:03:49.256 --> 00:03:51.433
♪ I'm cooler than
a pack of peppermints

00:03:51.476 --> 00:03:54.044
♪ And I haven't been
this excited

00:03:54.087 --> 00:03:56.568
♪ Since I can't remember when

00:03:56.612 --> 00:04:01.225
♪ I'm off
on this remarkable adventure

00:04:01.268 --> 00:04:03.880
♪ Just riding on a rainbow

00:04:03.923 --> 00:04:06.273
♪ But what if
it's all a big mistake?

00:04:06.317 --> 00:04:08.885
♪ What if
it's more than I can take?

00:04:08.928 --> 00:04:11.017
♪ No, I can't think that way

00:04:11.061 --> 00:04:14.891
♪ 'Cause I know
that I'm really,
really, really gonna be okay

00:04:14.934 --> 00:04:18.242
♪ Hey! I'm not
giving up today

00:04:18.285 --> 00:04:20.723
♪ There's nothing getting
in my way

00:04:20.766 --> 00:04:21.898
♪ And if you knock,
knock me over

00:04:21.941 --> 00:04:25.989
♪ I will get back up again

00:04:26.032 --> 00:04:27.817
♪ Oh, if something goes
a little wrong

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:30.123
♪ Well you can go ahead
and bring it on

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:31.951
♪ 'Cause if you knock,
knock me over

00:04:31.995 --> 00:04:35.085
♪ I will get back up again

00:04:35.128 --> 00:04:37.740
♪ Whoa, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh

00:04:37.783 --> 00:04:39.132
♪ Oh, get back up again

00:04:40.046 --> 00:04:42.266
♪ Whoa, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh

00:04:42.309 --> 00:04:43.441
♪ Oh

00:04:43.485 --> 00:04:45.443
I'm okay!

00:04:45.487 --> 00:04:47.576
♪ Whoa, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh

00:04:47.619 --> 00:04:48.925
♪ Oh

00:04:48.968 --> 00:04:49.926
♪ And if you knock,
knock me over

00:04:49.969 --> 00:04:51.449
